        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "YouTube channel management is the strategy, optimisation and growth of a brand or creator's YouTube channel: video SEO, titles, thumbnails, publishing cadence and community. Khalid Farhan has grown a large YouTube channel of his own, and the agency applies the same system to client channels."
